ather than a floor plan, then monitored once it is live so degradation is spotted before people complain. Across 2025 our average first response time was 9 minutes and our average resolution time was 6 hours, measured across every ticket we handled. We are a team of five engineers supporting more than 30 UK businesses, from two-user teams to organisations of 150+ users. WhizzIT is Cyber Essentials certified and a Microsoft Cloud Solution Provider, so our security fundamentals are independently assessed rather than simply claimed."},{"k":"u5","type":"u","label":"Link: Back to Network Management","default":"/network-management/"},{"k":"s6","type":"s","label":"Link text 1","default":"Back to Network Management"},{"k":"i7","type":"i","label":"Image 1","default":{"html":"<img src=\"{{ASSETS}}/images/photos/svc-business-wifi-services-1024.webp\" srcset=\"{{ASSETS}}/images/photos/svc-business-wifi-services-640.webp 640w, {{ASSETS}}/images/photos/svc-business-wifi-services-1024.webp 1024w, {{ASSETS}}/images/photos/svc-business-wifi-services-1600.webp 1600w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1024px) 45vw, 100vw\" alt=\"Wireless access point mounted on a ceiling cable tray\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\">","src":"{{ASSETS}}/images/photos/svc-business-wifi-services-1024.webp"}},{"k":"s8","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 4","default":"Network Management"},{"k":"s9","type":"s","label":"Bold text 1","default":"Business Wi-Fi & Wireless"},{"k":"s10","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 5","default":"What’s included"},{"k":"s11","type":"s","label":"List item 1","default":"Wireless site survey and coverage design"},{"k":"s12","type":"s","label":"List item 2","default":"Business-grade access points and controllers"},{"k":"s13","type":"s","label":"List item 3","default":"Separate, secured staff and guest networks"},{"k":"s14","type":"s","label":"List item 4","default":"Seamless roaming across access points"},{"k":"s15","type":"s","label":"List item 5","default":"Bandwidt